Error [E0225]: The move marker `^` here marks a fresh value, not a named place
  --> move_mark_borrowed.jet:18:14
    |
 18 |     fresh := ^make()
    |              ^
 Why: `^` moves a named place (`^xs`, `^buf.seal()`); a literal or call result is already new, so it needs no mark
 Fix: Remove `^`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0225
